{"seq":1,"slug":"version-control-strategy","title":"版本控制策略与仓库组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/version-control-strategy","wordCount":1061,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本控制策略与仓库组织\">版本控制策略与仓库组织</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>每位开发者的 Home 目录下散落着数十个配置文件——<code>.zshrc</code>、<code>.gitconfig</code>、<code>.config/nvim/</code>、<code>.ssh/config</code> 等。这些文件记录了多年积累的个性化设置、快捷键映射和工具偏好。如果不加以管理，一次系统重装或硬件故障就可能让这些心血付诸东流。将 dotfiles 纳入 Git 版本控制是现代开发者环境管理的第一步。</p>\n<p>本文深入讲解 dotfiles 仓库的架构设计、两种主流管理模式的对比选择、模块化组织策略以及安全规范，帮助读者建立一个清晰、安全、易维护的 dotfiles 版本控制体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"为什么要版本控制-dotfiles\">为什么要版本控制 Dotfiles</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更追踪</td>\n<td>每次修改都有 commit 记录，可随时回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨设备同步</td>\n<td>工作机、个人机、云开发环境使用同一份配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灾难恢复</td>\n<td>远程仓库备份，硬件故障不影响配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识积累</td>\n<td>commit history 记录了配置演进的思路和原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作分享</td>\n<td>公开仓库帮助他人，也倒逼自己保持良好习惯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"两种主流架构\">两种主流架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph A[&quot;Bare Repo 方式&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;~/.dotfiles/ 存 Git 元数据&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;工作树指向 ~&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;文件原地不动&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph B[&quot;Standard Repo + Symlink&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;~/dotfiles/ 标准 Git 仓库&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;按工具分目录&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[&quot;Stow/chezmoi 创建符号链接&quot;]&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[&quot;链接指向 ~ 对应位置&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph A[\"Bare Repo 方式\"]\n        A1[\"~/.dotfiles/ 存 Git 元数据\"] --&gt; A2[\"工作树指向 ~\"]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[\"文件原地不动\"]\n    end\n    subgraph B[\"Standard Repo + Symlink\"]\n        B1[\"~/dotfiles/ 标准 Git 仓库\"] --&gt; B2[\"按工具分目录\"]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[\"Stow/chezmoi 创建符号链接\"]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[\"链接指向 ~ 对应位置\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"bare-repo-方式\">Bare Repo 方式</h3><p>用 Git 的 <code>--bare</code> 和 <code>--work-tree</code> 参数将 Home 目录作为工作树，但 <code>.git</code> 元数据存放在别处：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 初始化&#10;git init --bare $HOME/.dotfiles&#10;&#10;# 定义别名（加入 .zshrc）&#10;alias dot=&#39;git --git-dir=$HOME/.dotfiles/ --work-tree=$HOME&#39;&#10;&#10;# 隐藏未追踪文件（否则 status 会显示整个 ~）&#10;dot config --local status.showUntrackedFiles no&#10;&#10;# 使用&#10;dot add ~/.zshrc&#10;dot commit -m &quot;Add zsh configuration&quot;&#10;dot push\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $HOME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/.dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 定义别名（加入 .zshrc）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">alias</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'git --git-dir=$HOME/.dotfiles/ --work-tree=$HOME'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 隐藏未追踪文件（否则 status 会显示整个 ~）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --local</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status.showUntrackedFiles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Add zsh configuration\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：文件保持原位，无符号链接，无需额外工具 <strong>缺点</strong>：初始设置命令不直观，不能在仓库根目录放 README</p>\n<h3 id=\"standard-repo-symlink\">Standard Repo + Symlink</h3><p>将所有配置文件集中在一个标准 Git 仓库中，通过工具创建符号链接到正确位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/dotfiles/&#10;├── README.md&#10;├── bootstrap.sh&#10;├── Brewfile&#10;├── zsh/&#10;│   └── .zshrc&#10;├── git/&#10;│   └── .gitconfig&#10;├── nvim/&#10;│   └── .config/nvim/&#10;│       └── init.lua&#10;├── starship/&#10;│   └── .config/starship.toml&#10;└── ghostty/&#10;    └── .config/ghostty/config\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/dotfiles/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── README.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── bootstrap.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Brewfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── zsh/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── git/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .gitconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── nvim/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .config/nvim/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── init.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── starship/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .config/starship.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── ghostty/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── .config/ghostty/config</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：仓库结构清晰，可放 README/scripts，模块化管理直观 <strong>缺点</strong>：需要符号链接工具，文件实际位置是链接</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"从零建立-dotfiles-仓库\">从零建立 Dotfiles 仓库</h3><h4 id=\"步骤一-确定架构\">步骤一：确定架构</h4><p>推荐选择 <strong>Standard Repo + GNU Stow</strong>，原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仓库可以包含文档、安装脚本、Brewfile 等非 dotfile 文件</li>\n<li>模块化天然支持（每个工具一个目录）</li>\n<li>新机器 clone + stow 即可完成部署</li>\n<li>团队分享更直观</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"步骤二-创建仓库结构\">步骤二：创建仓库结构</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir ~/dotfiles &amp;&amp; cd ~/dotfiles&#10;git init&#10;&#10;# 按工具创建模块目录&#10;mkdir -p zsh git nvim starship ghostty tmux&#10;&#10;# 移动现有配置到对应模块&#10;# 注意：目录结构需要镜像文件在 ~ 中的相对路径&#10;mv ~/.zshrc zsh/.zshrc&#10;mv ~/.gitconfig git/.gitconfig&#10;mv ~/.config/nvim nvim/.config/nvim&#10;mv ~/.config/starship.toml starship/.config/starship.toml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按工具创建模块目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nvim</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostty</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tmux</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 移动现有配置到对应模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 注意：目录结构需要镜像文件在 ~ 中的相对路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh/.zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.gitconfig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git/.gitconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/nvim</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nvim/.config/nvim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/starship.toml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship/.config/starship.toml</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"步骤三-用-gnu-stow-创建链接\">步骤三：用 GNU Stow 创建链接</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Stow&#10;brew install stow&#10;&#10;# 部署所有模块（从 ~/dotfiles 目录执行）&#10;cd ~/dotfiles&#10;stow zsh git nvim starship ghostty tmux&#10;&#10;# Stow 会创建符号链接：&#10;# ~/dotfiles/zsh/.zshrc → ~/.zshrc&#10;# ~/dotfiles/nvim/.config/nvim → ~/.config/nvim&#10;# ...&#10;&#10;# 部署单个模块&#10;stow zsh&#10;&#10;# 移除模块的链接&#10;stow -D zsh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Stow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署所有模块（从 ~/dotfiles 目录执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nvim</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostty</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tmux</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Stow 会创建符号链接：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/dotfiles/zsh/.zshrc → ~/.zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/dotfiles/nvim/.config/nvim → ~/.config/nvim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署单个模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 移除模块的链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"步骤四-配置-gitignore\">步骤四：配置 .gitignore</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"gitignore\" data-code=\"# ~/dotfiles/.gitignore&#10;&#10;# 操作系统文件&#10;.DS_Store&#10;Thumbs.db&#10;&#10;# 编辑器临时文件&#10;*.swp&#10;*.swo&#10;*~&#10;&#10;# 安全相关——绝不提交&#10;*.pem&#10;*.key&#10;.env&#10;.env.local&#10;&#10;# 本机特有配置&#10;local/&#10;*.local\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/dotfiles/.gitignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 操作系统文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.DS_Store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thumbs.db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 编辑器临时文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.swp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.swo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*~</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 安全相关——绝不提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.pem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.env.local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 本机特有配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.local</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模块化组织进阶\">模块化组织进阶</h3><h4 id=\"目录命名规范\">目录命名规范</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/dotfiles/&#10;├── core/           # 每台机器都需要的基础配置&#10;│   ├── zsh/&#10;│   ├── git/&#10;│   └── starship/&#10;├── dev/            # 开发相关（可选部署）&#10;│   ├── nvim/&#10;│   ├── tmux/&#10;│   └── docker/&#10;├── gui/            # GUI 应用配置（仅桌面机）&#10;│   ├── ghostty/&#10;│   └── aerospace/&#10;└── platform/       # 平台特有&#10;    ├── macos/&#10;    └── linux/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/dotfiles/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── core/           # 每台机器都需要的基础配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── zsh/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── git/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── starship/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── dev/            # 开发相关（可选部署）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── nvim/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── tmux/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── docker/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── gui/            # GUI 应用配置（仅桌面机）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ghostty/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── aerospace/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── platform/       # 平台特有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── macos/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── linux/</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"选择性部署\">选择性部署</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 服务器只部署 core&#10;cd ~/dotfiles &amp;&amp; stow -d core zsh git starship&#10;&#10;# 开发机部署 core + dev + gui&#10;cd ~/dotfiles&#10;for dir in core/*/ dev/*/ gui/*/; do&#10;    stow -d &quot;$(dirname $dir)&quot; &quot;$(basename $dir)&quot;&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 服务器只部署 core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发机部署 core + dev + gui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core/*/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev/*/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gui/*/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    stow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dirname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">basename</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分支策略\">分支策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;Initial setup&quot;&#10;    branch work-machine&#10;    checkout work-machine&#10;    commit id: &quot;Add work-specific configs&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    branch personal-machine&#10;    commit id: &quot;Add personal configs&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    commit id: &quot;Update shared configs&quot;&#10;    checkout work-machine&#10;    merge main&#10;    checkout personal-machine&#10;    merge main\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"Initial setup\"\n    branch work-machine\n    checkout work-machine\n    commit id: \"Add work-specific configs\"\n    checkout main\n    branch personal-machine\n    commit id: \"Add personal configs\"\n    checkout main\n    commit id: \"Update shared configs\"\n    checkout work-machine\n    merge main\n    checkout personal-machine\n    merge main</pre><p>对于轻度差异，推荐使用条件配置而非分支（详见下篇 chezmoi 模板）。分支适合差异极大的场景（如 macOS vs Linux 完全不同的窗口管理器配置）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"安全规范清单\">安全规范清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>永不提交密钥</td>\n<td><code>.gitignore</code> + <code>git-secrets</code> pre-commit hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSH 配置安全</td>\n<td>提交 <code>~/.ssh/config</code> 结构，私钥和已知主机用 <code>.gitignore</code> 排除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量隔离</td>\n<td>创建 <code>.env.local</code>（gitignored），在 <code>.zshrc</code> 中 <code>source</code> 它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计工具</td>\n<td>安装 <code>git-secrets</code> 或 <code>gitleaks</code> 在提交前扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 git-secrets&#10;brew install git-secrets&#10;&#10;# 在 dotfiles 仓库中启用&#10;cd ~/dotfiles&#10;git secrets --install&#10;git secrets --register-aws  # 检测 AWS 密钥模式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 git-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-secrets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 dotfiles 仓库中启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secrets</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secrets</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --register-aws</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 检测 AWS 密钥模式</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"commit-message-规范\">Commit Message 规范</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"type(scope): description&#10;&#10;# 类型&#10;feat(zsh): add fzf-tab integration&#10;fix(git): correct merge tool path&#10;refactor(nvim): modularize plugin config&#10;docs: update README with install instructions&#10;chore: update Brewfile\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type(scope): description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>feat(zsh): add fzf-tab integration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fix(git): correct merge tool path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>refactor(nvim): modularize plugin config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>docs: update README with install instructions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>chore: update Brewfile</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"定期维护节奏\">定期维护节奏</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>有配置变更时及时 commit（避免大杂烩提交）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td><code>brew update &amp;&amp; brew upgrade</code> 后同步 Brewfile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>审查未追踪的新增配置文件，决定是否纳入管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每季</td>\n<td>清理不再使用的模块，更新 README</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"dotfiles-管理工具对比\">Dotfiles 管理工具对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>GNU Stow</strong></td>\n<td>符号链接管理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单、稳定、无依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>chezmoi</strong></td>\n<td>全功能管理器</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多机差异、密钥加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>yadm</strong></td>\n<td>Git 包装器</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>bare repo 的便捷封装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>rcm</strong></td>\n<td>符号链接管理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>thoughtbot 风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>bare repo + alias</strong></td>\n<td>原生 Git</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>极简主义者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"社区参考\">社区参考</h3><p>优秀的开源 dotfiles 仓库值得研究其组织方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>mathiasbynens/dotfiles</strong>：macOS 设置脚本的标杆</li>\n<li><strong>holman/dotfiles</strong>：Topic-based 组织范式</li>\n<li><strong>thoughtbot/dotfiles</strong>：简洁、rcm 管理</li>\n<li><strong>webpro/awesome-dotfiles</strong>：dotfiles 资源合集</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Dotfiles 版本控制的核心价值不仅是备份——它将你的开发环境从&quot;仅存在于这台机器上的隐式知识&quot;转变为&quot;可追踪、可部署、可分享的显式基础设施&quot;。Standard Repo + GNU Stow 是大多数开发者的最佳起点：足够简单、无魔法、易于理解。当需求增长到多机差异化配置和密钥管理时，再升级到 chezmoi 也完全平滑。无论选择哪种方案，今天就开始——把你的 <code>.zshrc</code> 放进 Git，这个习惯的复利将在未来每一次换机时回报给你。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本控制策略与仓库组织","id":"版本控制策略与仓库组织"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要版本控制 Dotfiles","id":"为什么要版本控制-dotfiles"},{"level":3,"text":"两种主流架构","id":"两种主流架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Bare Repo 方式","id":"bare-repo-方式"},{"level":3,"text":"Standard Repo + Symlink","id":"standard-repo-symlink"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"从零建立 Dotfiles 仓库","id":"从零建立-dotfiles-仓库"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤一：确定架构","id":"步骤一-确定架构"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤二：创建仓库结构","id":"步骤二-创建仓库结构"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤三：用 GNU Stow 创建链接","id":"步骤三-用-gnu-stow-创建链接"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤四：配置 .gitignore","id":"步骤四-配置-gitignore"},{"level":3,"text":"模块化组织进阶","id":"模块化组织进阶"},{"level":4,"text":"目录命名规范","id":"目录命名规范"},{"level":4,"text":"选择性部署","id":"选择性部署"},{"level":3,"text":"分支策略","id":"分支策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"安全规范清单","id":"安全规范清单"},{"level":3,"text":"Commit Message 规范","id":"commit-message-规范"},{"level":3,"text":"定期维护节奏","id":"定期维护节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Dotfiles 管理工具对比","id":"dotfiles-管理工具对比"},{"level":3,"text":"社区参考","id":"社区参考"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Starship 提示符与终端美化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/terminal-shell-setup/starship-prompt-terminal-aesthetics"},"next":{"title":"跨设备同步与条件配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/cross-device-sync-conditional-config"}}